/obj/item/paper/crumpled/bloody{
	default_raw_text = "<i>Scheiße, I knew this would happen eventually. Legions have been piling up outside for days, and one of my former coworkers was unwise enough to let them in.<BR><BR>...They're all dead. I can hear the legions outside. The display case with the Claris is locked tight, and I cant find anything to break the glass with.<BR><BR>Please forgive me. My time is up. If anyone finds this, the Claris is yours. Just avenge us.</i>";
